      "finding": "Existing synchronous failure notifications can invoke a termination listener while continuation work is retained. A listener that synchronously calls runtime.shutdown can wait for the same work. QueuedRequestScheduler.closePlan has the analogous admission-handle condition. No such production termination listener was found; this conditional pre-existing protocol risk was not refactored in this review."
